Package: canmodels
Type: Project
Title: Configurable Causal Attitude Network Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Moses", "Boudourides", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A configuration-driven R research workflow that implements the CAN
    computations reported by Abadi et al. using the authors' public original
    four-country Study 2 data as a reproducible example, while treating
    the restricted 15-country Study 1 data as explicitly access-gated.
